PHYSIOS includes software derived from ROBOTIS physical_ai_tools
(https://github.com/ROBOTIS-GIT/physical_ai_tools, commit dcaa3ab, 30 Oct 2026),
Copyright 2025 ROBOTIS CO., LTD., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  robot/src/physical_ai_server     robot server (ROS 2). PHYSIOS adds the planning engine
                                   (physical_ai_server/planning, test/planning) and its
                                   services, and changes the in-container training folder.
  robot/src/physical_ai_interfaces ROS 2 messages and services (PHYSIOS adds PlanningCommand)
  robot/src/rosbag_recorder        ROS 2 bag recorder service
  frontend/                        derived from physical_ai_manager (PHYSIOS v4 interface)
  tests/e2e/run_e2e.py, opt_ui_check.py, standin_server.py
                                   test helpers derived from physical_ai_manager/e2e

These copies are maintained in this repository; PHYSIOS does not need a physical_ai_tools
checkout. The original copyright headers are kept in the derived files.

The robot runtime image downloads LeRobot (https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot,
Apache License 2.0) at the commit recorded in robot/lerobot.lock.
